{
  "_comment": [
    "Which Playwright specs a change needs. scripts/ci-plan.mjs reads this file.",
    "features: a changed path matching 'paths' runs the listed smoke-project specs.",
    "shared: code every screen uses. A change here, or to a path no entry covers, runs the essential set.",
    "The co-founder UI is an essential screen, including its mode-off guard regression.",
    "essential: the core journeys, run by the 'essential' and 'essential-focus' Playwright projects.",
    "essential.focus: heavy specs run only for the named tests (a case-sensitive title regex).",
    "The full suite stays available by hand: Actions > CI full suite."
