        "send a message and see it in timeline",
        "send message with Enter key",
        "message input clears after send",
        "sends a thread message to its parent channel with a root-thread link",
        "opens a single-level thread panel with inline expansion",
        "thread composer keeps focus after sending a thread reply",
        "mentioning an in-channel stopped managed agent publishes first and starts it detached",
        "a second mention while the first wake is in flight does not start the agent twice",
        "a failed publish drops the queued agent wake and never claims the message was sent",
        "mentioning a non-member managed agent adds it before sending and starts it detached",
        "selecting a managed agent mention inserts @Name into input",
        "sidebar shows all channel types",
